<title>UK: REUTERS 58TH EX-UK AIR CARGO MARKET REPORT.</title>
<headline>REUTERS 58TH EX-UK AIR CARGO MARKET REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-01-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Below are the current average ex-UK GBP air cargo market rates per kg for a 100kg shipment, with a volume-to-weight ratio of six-to-one. Rates are inclusive of cargo fuel surcharges being applied to airlines.</p>
<p>			Jan 10	     Dec 18</p>
<p>		   UNITED STATES</p>
<p> LON-JFK	    0.62		0.63</p>
<p> LON-LAX	    0.73		0.75</p>
<p> LON-CHI	    0.73		0.75</p>
<p>		   ASIA-PACIFIC</p>
<p> LON-HKG	    1.23		1.25</p>
<p> LON-SIN	    1.29		1.30</p>
<p> LON-NRT	    2.04		2.10</p>
<p> LON-SEL	    2.07		2.05</p>
<p> LON-SYD	    2.15		2.19</p>
<p>		   MIDDLE EAST</p>
<p> LON-DXB	    0.81		0.87</p>
<p> LON-BAH	    0.93		0.95</p>
<p>		   AFRICA</p>
<p> LON-JNB	    1.73		1.80</p>
<p>		   SCANDINAVIA</p>
<p> LON-STO	    0.75		0.76</p>
<p> LON-CPH	    0.70		0.72</p>
<p>		   LATIN AMERICA</p>
<p> LON-SAO	    2.04		2.08</p>
<p> LON-BUE	    2.19		2.23</p>
<p>*The rates quoted in this report were obtained by Reuters journalists on confidential basis from a range of airlines, large forwarders and smaller air cargo agents based at the three main London airports.</p>
<p>*All prices quoted in sterling.</p>
<p>*The tariffs represent average rates calculated from a range of prices and are indicative or current market activity. - Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 7706 Fax+44 171 542 5017</p>
